## Observation: bot.attackNpc() is SLOW
what: High-level attackNpc walks to target, waits for full combat end, handles errors
problem: At combat 43 vs chickens Lvl 1, I one-shot them. The walk/wait overhead wastes time.
insight: Should use low-level sdk.sendInteractNpc() for speed — skip pathfinding, just click and move on
todo: Write a fast-kill script that uses low-level SDK

## Observation: Not looting drops
what: Killed 15 chickens, got 0 raw chicken in inventory
problem: Drops fall on ground but script never picks them up between kills
insight: Need to check groundItems after each kill and pick up raw chicken + bones
bones: Bury for Prayer XP (already 27, want 55 for initiate build)
raw_chicken: Cook on range for food — free HP recovery

## Observation: Dark Wizards nearly killed me
what: Walking from cow field to Draynor bank, arrived at 14/41 HP
why: Defence 1 means magic attacks hit full damage. Dark wizards are aggressive south of Draynor.
lesson: ALWAYS check route dangers before walking. Carry food when traveling.
safe_route: Go north through Lumbridge to Varrock bank instead, or approach Draynor from north

## Observation: Pickpocketing men is bad at low Thieving
what: 3gp per success but frequent stuns that trigger combat
problem: At Thieving 7, fail rate is high. Stun = man attacks = stuck in combat for 30+ seconds
lesson: Not worth it for gold at this level. Better to kill things and sell drops.

## Observation: Bronze sword at combat 43
what: Still using starter weapon
problem: Attack is 42 — can use up to Rune weapons. Bronze sword is terrible DPS.
priority: Need money to buy a better weapon. Mithril scimitar from Zeke costs 1040gp.
alt: Could buy steel scimitar for 400gp as a stepping stone

